    <briefdescription>
<para>Validates Phase 5 diagnostic APIs: SFF_BIST, PIN_STAT, FAULT_MASK, off-state OC/OL diagnostics and the supply-monitor self-test. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Hardware:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>TLE92466ED evaluation board</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No load required (BIST + self-tests are purely internal)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Expected output:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>BIST: done=1, fail=0</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>PIN_STAT: reports EN and FAULTN state</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Supply monitor self-test: all four phases report overall pass</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Masking a fault removes its contribution to FAULTN </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
